# PSR-4b-api-deps — API membership inventory + ratchet

## Scope

| Work | Done |
| --- | --- |
| Inventory `apps/api` `@app-tour/workspace-*` deps vs manifests | Yes |
| Exact-set completeness ratchet (no orphans / no missing) | Yes |
| Extend `guard:host-workspace-deps` for API missing deps | Yes |
| Dedicated ops smoke | Yes |
| Codegen rewrite of `apps/api/package.json` | **No** (deferred) |
| Delete fixture finance/booking deps | **No** |

## Baseline (verified)

| Metric | Value |
| --- | ---: |
| Manifest packages | 12 |
| API product deps (`≠ sdk`) | **12** (exact match) |
| API + sdk | 13 |
| Orphans | 0 |
| Missing | 0 |

### Classes

| Class | Packages |
| --- | --- |
| Platform | `@app-tour/workspace-sdk` |
| Product trunk | acme, denali, guest-club, harbor, starter, urban |
| Registry fixture | booking-ws2, finance-ws2…ws6 |

## Guard change

`guard-host-workspace-deps` previously blocked **orphans** on web+api and
**web completeness** via I.8 verify. PSR-4b-api-deps adds **API completeness**:
every `workspace.manifest.json` `package` must appear in `apps/api` deps.

## Why no package.json rewrite this wave

Membership is already exact. A generate writer (web I.8 analogue) would be
pure ceremony until drift appears. Follow-on: `PSR-4b-api-deps-sync`.

## Local smoke

```bash
node scripts/ops/psr-4b-api-deps-smoke.mjs
pnpm run guard:host-workspace-deps
```

## Exit gate

| Check | Result |
| --- | --- |
| Inventory classifies all API workspace deps | required |
| Exact-set smoke + host guard green | required |
| No package.json mutation | required |
| No fixture dep deletion | required |
